  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\nI’d like if the admin account_data API was extended to allow setting account data. It currently only supports viewing the account data. \r\n\r\nThe only way to set account data is currently by using `PUT /_matrix/client/v3/user/{userId}/account_data/{type}` as defined here: [Matrix API](https://matrix.org/docs/api/#put-/_matrix/client/v3/user/-userId-/account_data/-type-) \r\n\r\nI don’t know how many practical uses this would have but I’d need it to add [Stickerpicker](https://github.com/maunium/stickerpicker)  stickers for other users.\r\n\r\nAs a workaround I’ve simply modified this line on [account_data.py](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/4ec40b16ac2436387d5d947308e5dc37857acbf6/synapse/rest/client/account_data.py#L241) \r\n\r\n```python\r\nif user_id != requester.user.to_string():\r\n```\r\n```python\r\nif user_id != requester.user.to_string() and requester.user.to_string() != “@adminaccount:myserver.tld”:\r\n```\r\n\r\nhttps://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/latest/admin_api/user_admin_api.html#account-data",
